vulkan-systems
  gpu/        generic VulkanEngine GPU resources, compute, synchronization
  render/     generic Vulkan graphics pipelines, targets, mesh and draws
  bvh/        GPU LBVH spatial acceleration
  transport/  GPU diffuse light transport

Each implemented system is an independent C++17 c build static library
with its own build.c, extensionless readme, and namespaced public headers.
GPU and render own no game or fluid policy; simulations supply GPU
geometry/resources and renderer consumes them with explicit synchronization.
VulkanEngine must be initialized by the host before using these systems.
